1
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:11,990
Profiles keeps different screen layouts. Type a name and Create to save the current one.

2
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:23,250
Theme chooses dark or light, and the font size.

3
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:28,410
Price Changer sets prices for many instruments at once: select them, move the price with the quick buttons, and Apply.

4
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,400
Apply changes the price for every trader. Here we close without changing anything.

5
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:41,180
Order Depth shows pending orders by price for an instrument.

6
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:48,100
Settings, Account: your dealer details, the time zone for all times, and the currency money is shown in.

7
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:55,040
Notifications: which events pop up, and whether to confirm before you execute or reject an order.

8
00:00:55,140 --> 00:01:00,460
Security changes your password.

9
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:05,270
Session logs you out.

